                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center"><seg type="margin">[166]</seg> *[Inclosure No.
                        1.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barlow, United
                        States marshal, to Mr. Boar,
                        Attorney-General.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi>
                        14, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p>The Hornet, a long side-wheel steamer, is said to be going from Philadelphia
                    to-night as a Cuban privateer. I have telegraphed the fact to the United States
                    marshal at Philadelphia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANCIS C. BARLOW,<lb/><seg type="margin">[136]</seg> *<hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Marshal, New York.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
